OL,3,GNEWSALow-cost clinic helps pet owners
OL,4,Awith vet bills
OL,5,
OL,6,FA reduced-cost veterinary clinic has
OL,7,Ftreated 160 pets in its first 11 days,
OL,8,Faccording to the RSPCA.
OL,10,FThe animal charity's Medway West branch
OL,11,Fhas launched to offer cut-price care
OL,12,Ffor the pets of people on low incomes
OL,13,For receiving benefits.
OL,15,F"Your pet would come first. You'd have
OL,16,Fa bit of toast yourself and pay out for
OL,17,Fyour pet," said Chatham cat owner
OL,18,FChristine Gardner. "Having somewhere
OL,19,Flike this is amazing."
